; Morthul, the Ash King (the finish run, Act IV) — the god of entropy and the last fight in the game.
; The largest health pool of any enemy, heavy armour and deep resistances, and a real spell school:
; he casts through the ordinary spellcasting path (SpellPower, Mana, ManaRegen on the archetype).
; He is slow on his feet and slow to swing; what makes him the hardest fight is that he stops being
; a thing you can stand next to.
